            },
            {
              "type": "markdown",
              "content": "  {% set soc = states('sensor.total_house_soc')|float(0) %}\n  {% set base = states('sensor.solar_dump_base_target')|float(0) %}\n  {% set mult = ([1.0, 10.5 - (0.1 * soc), 3.0]|sort)[1] %}\n\n  **Current Status**\n  * **Battery SoC:** {{ soc }}%\n  * **Base Target:** {{ base }}%\n  * *(Current Multiplier: {{ mult | round(2) }}x)*\n  \n  **Thresholds (Disable to Enable)**\n  * **Level 1 (EV or AQS):** {{ (base - mult) | round(1) }}% to {{ base | round(1) }}%\n  * **Level 2 (EV + AQS):** {{ base | round(1) }}% to {{ (base + mult) | round(1) }}%\n  * **Level 3 (Rooms AC):** {% if soc > 90 %}{{ (base + mult) | round(1) }}% to {{ (base + (2 * mult)) | round(1) }}%{% else %}n/a until Battery > 90%{% endif %}\n  * **Level 4 (Living Room AC):** {% if soc > 90 %}{{ (base + (2 * mult)) | round(1) }}% to {{ (base + (3 * mult)) | round(1) }}%{% else %}n/a until Battery > 90%{% endif %}",
              "title": "⚡ Solar Dump Status",
              "view_layout": {
                "position": "sidebar"
              }
            },
