                      "content": "{% set el_sun = state_attr('sun.sun', 'elevation') | float(0) %} {% set master = states('input_boolean.shades_master_switch') %} {% set heat_shield = states('input_boolean.hot_day_heat_shield') %} <div style=\"font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"> Zone Control Gateways:<br> • NE Unobstructed (Lara, Lucas) ➔ Active above 5° Sun Elevation<br> • NE Obstructed (Patio, Dinner, Kitchen) ➔ Active above 18° Sun Elevation<br> • SW/NW Standard & Awning (Suite, Bath, Stairs) ➔ Active above 9° Sun Elevation\n<hr style=\"border: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--divider-color); margin: 8px 0;\">\nCurrent Tracking Metrics:<br> • Sun Elevation: {{ el_sun | round(1) }}°<br> • Heat Shield Status: {{ 'ENGAGED (One-Way Locking)' if heat_shield == 'on' else 'IDLE (Standard Light Tracking)' }}\n<hr style=\"border: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--divider-color); margin: 8px 0;\">\nSystem Verdict:<br> {% if master == 'off' %}\n  🛑 *System Disabled: Master Switch is OFF.*\n{% elif heat_shield == 'on' %}\n  🔥 *Heat Shield Mode Active: Blinds will only lower further to block solar gains.*\n{% else %}\n  🍃 *Standard Mode Active: Blinds dynamically track shadow line positions bidirectionally.*\n{% endif %} </div>"
                    }
                  ]
                },
